of saying that I say, feed what you want to grow.

00:34:52.900 --> 00:34:55.140
But yes, celebrate the behavior that you want to see,

00:34:55.140 --> 00:34:56.420
feed what you want to grow.

00:34:56.420 --> 00:34:59.500
That is one of the most important things to do

00:34:59.500 --> 00:35:01.660
when you are trying to shape culture

00:35:01.660 --> 00:35:03.140
is you ignore the stuff that you don't want.

00:35:03.140 --> 00:35:04.220
You don't try to tamp it out

00:35:04.220 --> 00:35:06.340
