So instead you feed it and you,

00:35:09.380 --> 00:35:11.140
and unless it's actively dangerous

00:35:11.140 --> 00:35:13.540
and you like need to stamp, tamp it out,

00:35:13.540 --> 00:35:15.980
you just ignore the stuff that you don't want,

00:35:15.980 --> 00:35:17.860
feed the stuff that you do want

00:35:17.860 --> 00:35:19.820
and it grows like a garden.

