00:43:30.640 --> 00:43:32.080
they wanna stay in this role

00:43:32.080 --> 00:43:33.240
where they're responsible for quality

00:43:33.240 --> 00:43:34.480
and set up for failure.

00:43:35.520 --> 00:43:37.920
I'm not against, clear roles I believe in.

