00:43:45.560 --> 00:43:47.840
that roles are a root cause of quality.

00:43:47.840 --> 00:43:49.680
Like, let me give you one more example.

00:43:49.680 --> 00:43:51.920
Now I'm talking about metrics and I'll let you talk.

00:43:51.920 --> 00:43:54.520
Every time there's some weird,

00:43:54.520 --> 00:43:56.080
this drives me crazy.

00:43:56.080 --> 00:43:58.040
You know about,

00:43:58.040 --> 00:44:01.040
if you read the Decker work on safety systems

00:44:03.180 --> 00:44:04.100
like drift into failure,

00:44:04.100 --> 00:44:07.020
where a failure isn't the cause of one,

00:44:07.020 --> 00:44:09.740
usually these days especially, even in software,

00:44:09.740 --> 00:44:10.940
