00:44:10.940 --> 00:44:12.940
It's like 10 things went wrong at once.

00:44:13.940 --> 00:44:15.300
Going back to the Challenger disaster,

00:44:15.300 --> 00:44:16.460
great example of that.

00:44:17.500 --> 00:44:19.220
What drives me wild is,

00:44:19.220 --> 00:44:20.260
and this is total tangent,

00:44:20.260 --> 00:44:22.740
but this is the nature of the podcast,

