The tester didn't do their job.

00:44:35.460 --> 00:44:37.940
Here's what I would have done if I was testing this.

00:44:37.940 --> 00:44:39.020
And now they're blaming AI,

00:44:39.020 --> 00:44:40.660
but still they're blaming that.

00:44:40.660 --> 00:44:45.100
It's the same thing,

00:44:46.060 --> 00:44:47.660
but it's not there.

00:44:47.660 --> 00:44:51.500
And you and I know this because we see it as a system.

00:44:51.500 --> 00:44:55.540
When these big errors happen that people notice,

