Oh, a hundred percent.

00:45:20.760 --> 00:45:23.160
When people make a mistake,

00:45:23.160 --> 00:45:25.120
and it's something I also say often,

00:45:25.120 --> 00:45:26.640
when people make a mistake,

00:45:26.640 --> 00:45:28.000
it's not because they were malicious.

00:45:28.000 --> 00:45:29.840
It's not because they were dumb.

00:45:29.840 --> 00:45:32.520
It's because they felt safe making the decision

00:45:32.560 --> 00:45:35.060
given the information they had at that time.

00:45:35.060 --> 00:45:37.700
And which, if something bad happens,

00:45:37.700 --> 00:45:39.700
to me, it's a flaw in the system

00:45:39.700 --> 00:45:41.820
and we have to go fix the system that it's in.

00:45:41.820 --> 00:45:42.660
Hundred percent.

00:45:42.660 --> 00:45:43.500
Absolutely.

00:45:43.500 --> 00:45:44.660
I mean, I will say even if somebody

