00:52:39.550 --> 00:52:40.670
They're all levers.

00:52:40.670 --> 00:52:43.270
The problems happen when we pull levers

00:52:43.270 --> 00:52:44.230
in the wrong sequence,

00:52:44.230 --> 00:52:46.910
