00:52:57.230 --> 00:52:58.070
Massive, yes.

00:52:58.070 --> 00:52:59.070
Everything's connected.

00:52:59.070 --> 00:53:01.070
You can't just flip levers randomly.

00:53:01.070 --> 00:53:02.030
100%.

